  "body": "【Revelation】 - Forget 1 learned {Trait} of your choice (<i>crossing it off from your records</i>). Then, discard a card with that {Trait} from your hand or play area. If you cannot, take 1 horror instead. If you have not learned any {Traits}, shuffle Forgotten Knowledge back into your deck instead. ",
